{
  "title": "Expected staging and core values of every position row in the link-rules cases, worked out by hand",
  "reasoning": [
    "Written by hand from the contract and each case's own reasoning, not by running any code (Casey's rule for the conformance fixture). The link-rules case files are not changed; this file sits beside them in warehouse-eng's folder.",
    "position_quality (pos_01): usable for 15 to 32 bits, coarse for 12 to 14, unusable otherwise, so 33 and -1 are unusable; null for a row with no position.",
    "position_zero_mapped (pos_03): true only for a Position at 0, 0 (c31-m002), which then has no position.",
    "A row has no position when it is zero-mapped or lacks a coordinate (c31-m003, no latitude); its quality and precise flag are null, and it is not inside the MSA and not in core.",
    "precise_source (pos_04): true when seen_meshstl is true and precision_bits is 20 or more, or 0 with coordinates, Position or MapReport. The MeshSTL rows are c13-m003 (20 bits), c15-m003 (20), c16-m003 (32), c18-m002 to m005 (32), c41-m001 (16, so false), c41-m003 (20), c44-m003, m009, m015 and m021 (20 each), and c52-m004, c53-m005, c54-m004, c55-m004 and c55-m011 (20 each). Every other row is public-only and false. The copies of one broadcast in c52 to c55 reached different gateways, so each is its own delivery here and keeps its own flag; the link rules read a broadcast as one position, precise if any copy qualifies (ADR 0003). No link-rules row is a MeshSTL position at 0 bits, Position or MapReport (Casey, issue #55 comment 6989099568, item 2).",
    "inside_msa (pos_02, the stored value): every position is in or near St. Louis County, 38.0 to 38.7 N and 90.0 to 90.7 W, inside the polygon, except c28-m003 and c28-m004 near 92 W (c28's reasoning: outside), c29-m003, 28.7 m south of the boundary (c29's reasoning: outside), and c50-m003, whose 32-bit stored value is 3.45 mm outside (c50's reasoning; its cell centre is inside, but pos_02 reads the stored value). c29-m002 is 28.7 m inside, c50-m002's stored value 4.08 mm inside (its centre outside), and c50-m001 about 3.5 km inside.",
    "in_core: inside the MSA. The link-rules fixture is one snapshot with one row per delivery, so every inside row is its delivery's only copy, and core takes its own flags, so its core precise flag equals precise_source."
  ],
  "columns": ["delivery_key", "position_quality", "position_zero_mapped", "precise_source", "inside_msa", "in_core"],
